        "The Blue Jays finish this afternoon against the Reds at 3:07 PM ET on Sportsnet, and the last box score from last night was a 5-1 loss. Max Scherzer gets the ball in the season finale, while the Raptors keep building toward their first preseason game Oct. 3 against Miami and their regular-season opener Oct. 21 against Chicago. In Washington, the Commanders host Seattle at 1:00 PM ET on FOX, and the line for the morning coffee is simple: watch the pass rush on the first drive."
